    "title": "Levi's - Shop Denim & More",
    "description": "The best of Levi\u2019s\u00ae jeans, tailored just for you. From exclusive product launches to personalized recommendations, we\u2019re making it easier than ever to be part of our world. Download it today and access:\r\n\r\nQUICK & SIMPLE SHOPPING\r\n\r\nThe easiest way to find your favorite denim, shirts, Trucker Jackets and essential clothes. Browse your favorites from anywhere at any time.\r\n\r\nEXCLUSIVE PRODUCT DROPS\r\n\r\nDownload the app and you\u2019ll be first in line for exclusive styles and special collections you can\u2019t find anywhere else. One-of-a-kind pieces and fresh collaborations are all at your fingertips.\r\n\r\nA CUSTOM EXPERIENCE\r\n\r\nYour style is your own. So we\u2019re stepping up your Levi\u2019s\u00ae experience with personalized stories, offers and suggestions.\r\n\r\nSTYLE TIPS FROM THE EXPERTS\r\n\r\nWant to know how to wear or care for your new denim? We\u2019ll bring you special guidance straight from our stylists.\r\n\r\nCOME ON IN\r\n\r\nAllow background Location Access to explore Levi's\u00ae stores, events and offers near you.",
